This is a placeholder for the screenshot.

To replace this with an actual screenshot:
1. Take a screenshot of the viewer at http://127.0.0.1:8000/viewer
2. Save it as docs/screenshot.png
3. Delete this placeholder file

Recommended screenshot:
- Load the elephant_walk part to show all parts in one view
- Use a clean browser window (no toolbars)
- 1600x900 or similar widescreen aspect ratio
- Include the parts dropdown and 3D viewer area
